{"seq":1,"slug":"green-claims-substantiation","title":"绿色声明证实与反漂绿合规（Green Claims 指令）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/green-claims-listing-risk/green-claims-substantiation","wordCount":2794,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"绿色声明证实与反漂绿合规-green-claims-指令\">绿色声明证实与反漂绿合规（Green Claims 指令）</h1><p>一家贴着「Climate Neutral Certified」贴纸的跨境卖家，在同一上架批次里同时撞上两套规则：欧盟《赋能消费者绿色转型指令》把「基于抵消的碳中和声明」列为<strong>任何情况下都禁止</strong>的商业行为，而欧盟《绿色声明指令》——本要规定「如何证实绿色声明」的那部法规——在 2025 年 6 月第三次三方会谈被取消后陷入停滞。跨境电商工程必须接受这个不对称：<strong>证实细则还在难产，禁止性清单已经落地</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的监管拼图-一部生效指令与一部停滞指令\">2026 年的监管拼图：一部生效指令与一部停滞指令</h2><p>两部法规常被混为一谈，但法律状态完全不同，工程对策也完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>已经生效的是</strong> Directive (EU) 2024/825（《赋能消费者绿色转型指令》，ECGT）。它不新设独立法，而是修订《不公平商业行为指令》2005/29/EC：在附件一插入四条「任何情况下禁止」的行为，并修订第 6 条关于误导性行为的判定标准。时间表是硬的：成员国须在 <strong>2026-03-27</strong> 前完成国内转化立法，措施自 <strong>2026-09-27</strong> 起适用（第 4(1) 条，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32024L0825\">CELEX 32024L0825</a>）。这是 2026 年唯一确定要合规的截止日期。</p>\n<p><strong>停滞的是</strong>《绿色声明指令》（COM(2023) 166），它本要规定声明的证实标准、独立核验机构与标签治理。据欧洲议会立法追踪页（<a href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/legislative-train/theme-a-european-green-deal/file-substantiating-green-claims\">Legislative Train</a>）：议会 2024-03-12 通过一读立场，理事会 2024-06-17 通过一般方针，2025-01-28 与 04-24 两次三方会谈后，<strong>欧委会于 2025-06-20 宣布「拟撤回该提案」，06-23 第三次三方会谈取消</strong>。因撤回未在官方公报公布，该文件在《2026 年欧委会工作计划》（COM(2025) 870）中仍列 Pending——准确表述是「宣布拟撤回后受阻」。两部法规的工程含义因此分岔：ECGT 的硬禁止必须落到上架门控，绿色声明指令只值得做「预适配」。</p>\n<p>不要把平台合规押在绿色声明指令的细则上——它一个生效日期都没有；2026 年真正会开出罚单的是被 ECGT 修订后的 2005/29/EC 及各国转化立法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"被禁止的声明类型-把法条翻成可枚举的规则\">被禁止的声明类型：把法条翻成可枚举的规则</h2><p>反漂绿工程的第一层是「文本判定」——一条商品文案或标签图是否落入禁止清单。ECGT 通过附件一新增的四条给出可直接枚举的边界，另有第 6 条按个案判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条款</th>\n<th>禁止内容</th>\n<th>可实现的机器规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>附件一 2a</td>\n<td>展示既非基于认证方案、也非公共机构设立的<strong>可持续性标签</strong></td>\n<td>标签白名单：须挂在已登记的 Scheme 实体上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附件一 4a</td>\n<td>无「公认的卓越环境绩效」却说 <strong>generic 声明</strong>（green、eco-friendly、环保）</td>\n<td>通用词黑名单命中 → 要求具体指标 + 依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附件一 4b</td>\n<td>用<strong>某一属性</strong>的好处暗示<strong>整体产品/企业</strong>有环境效益</td>\n<td>主张对象校验：声明作用域 ⊂ 被证实属性作用域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附件一 4c</td>\n<td>基于<strong>温室气体抵消</strong>宣称产品「碳中和 / 减排 / 正向」</td>\n<td>抵消关键词 + 碳中和词共现 → 直接拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 6 条</td>\n<td>误导环境特性或循环性；未来绩效声明缺承诺、时限目标、实施计划、独立核验</td>\n<td>属性声明须挂证据字段；未来时态声明须挂承诺与核验凭证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键定义在 2005/29/EC 第 2(o)–(s) 条（由 2024/825 第 1(1) 条插入）。<strong>2a 与 4a 是一对</strong>：前者只允许基于认证方案或公共机构的标签，后者只允许有公认卓越绩效的通用词——合起来把「自制绿色小图标」和「无凭据的环保口号」封死，且都是<strong>场景无关的硬禁止</strong>。审核判定因此不是二元的，而是一条带作用域的分流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;文案 / 标签图 / A+&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;命中断言?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Z[&quot;放行&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C{&quot;附件一硬禁止?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;4c 抵消碳中和&quot;| X1[&quot;直接拦截&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;2a 非认证标签&quot;| X2[&quot;挂接 Scheme&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;4a 通用词&quot;| X3[&quot;要求指标&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;4b 越界&quot;| X4[&quot;收窄作用域&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| D{&quot;第 6 条个案?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Z&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;要求证据字段&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;证据完整?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| Z&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| W[&quot;降级 warn&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"文案 / 标签图 / A+\"] --&gt; B{\"命中断言?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"否\"| Z[\"放行\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"是\"| C{\"附件一硬禁止?\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"4c 抵消碳中和\"| X1[\"直接拦截\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"2a 非认证标签\"| X2[\"挂接 Scheme\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"4a 通用词\"| X3[\"要求指标\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"4b 越界\"| X4[\"收窄作用域\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"否\"| D{\"第 6 条个案?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| Z\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"要求证据字段\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"证据完整?\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"是\"| Z\n    F --&gt;|\"否\"| W[\"降级 warn\"]</pre><p>工程含义：<strong>硬禁止走拦截，个案类走证据完整性校验</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从声明到证据的证实链条\">核心概念：从声明到证据的证实链条</h2><p>这台洗衣机例子说明：要证实一条声明，需要从主张到凭证的完整链条而非一张截图。链条上每一环都是独立实体：**声明（Claim）**是文案、标签图或页面里一句可判定的环境主张；**主张对象（Object of Claim）**指明声明作用于谁——整个产品、某个部件还是某项工艺；**指标（Indicator）**是可量化的被声明量，如每洗一次循环的 kWh；**方法学（Methodology）**规定指标如何算出，如 PEF/PEFCR、ISO 14067；**数据（Dataset）**是支撑计算的清单数据；**核验（Verification）**是第三方核查；**凭证（Credential）**是带签名与有效期的可验证发布形态。链条顺序不可交换：没有主张对象就无法判定 4b 的作用域越界，没有方法学指标只是数字，没有凭证核验结论无法被复核。其中「主张对象」是 4b 的技术核心，必须显式建模成作用域字段——这与本 hub 在<a href=\"../certificate-data-verification-registry/certificate-entity-data-model\">证书实体数据模型</a>里的判断一致：把「被声明的对象」做成带命名空间的实体，比对才有确定目标。</p>\n<p>方法学一侧，欧盟官方口径是<strong>产品环境足迹（PEF）</strong>，由 Commission Recommendation (EU) 2021/2279 确立（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32021H2279\">CELEX 32021H2279</a>）：2021-12-15 通过并废止 2013/179/EU，规定<strong>若存在 PEFCR/OEFSR 就应使用它</strong>；2013–2018 试点阶段产出 19 个 PEFCR 与 2 个 OEFSR。单一得分按归一化加权计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF_{single} = \\sum_{i} \\frac{CF_i}{NF_i} \\cdot W_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3335em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为特征化结果，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NF_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为归一化因子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为权重）。一条「节能 30%」声明若无对应 PEFCR 支撑，就落在「无公认方法学」的灰区——这正是绿色声明指令本要消灭的灰区，但在它停滞的 2026 年，实务中退化为<strong>平台自行要求卖家提交方法学说明</strong>。证据完整度可形式化为覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>evidence</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{\\sum_{p \\in P} w_p \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{evidence}(p)]}{\\sum_{p \\in P} w_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8245em;vertical-align:-0.6672em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1572em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1667em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4603em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1667em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4603em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">evidence</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6672em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为证据位，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为风险权重）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 低于阈值即降级 warn。凭证有效性由<a href=\"../certificate-data-verification-registry/cert-lifecycle-expiry-revocation\">证书生命周期与失效撤销</a>的状态机承担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抵消型声明与碳信用-4c-如何改变核算边界\">抵消型声明与碳信用：4c 如何改变核算边界</h2><p>附件一 4c 是整部 ECGT 里对跨境卖家冲击最大的一条：它禁止<strong>基于温室气体抵消</strong>宣称产品具有「中性、减少或正向」的气候影响。过去常见的「购买碳信用抵消 → 贴碳中和标签」路径在欧盟境内不再合法，无论碳信用质量多高。但「抵消」本身未被禁止，被禁止的是<strong>用它做净额化声明</strong>。正确边界是把减排与移除分开披露：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GHG_{net} = GHG_{gross} - R_{removals} - E_{reductions}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{removals}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须是经认证的碳移除量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{reductions}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是价值链内减排量，两者都<strong>单独报告</strong>。</p>\n<p>欧盟的碳移除认证框架 Regulation (EU) 2024/3012（CRCF，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32024R3012\">CELEX 32024R3012</a>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{removals}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提供法律依据：<strong>自愿性</strong>框架，采用 QU.A.L.ITY 四条质量标准——量化（第 4 条，须证明净收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_{baseline} - CR_{total} - GHG_{associated} &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ssoc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）、额外性、长期储存、可持续性（第 5–7 条）；永久移除须储存「数个世纪」、碳农业活动期至少 5 年、产品中碳储存至少 35 年；核验依第 9 条由独立合格评定机构执行。CRCF 提供的凭证 <strong>certified carbon removal unit</strong> 因此只能作为「独立披露的事实」——这与<a href=\"../carbon-packaging-dpp-compliance/packaging-epr-recycling-registry\">包装 EPR 与回收登记</a>里「物理回收量与声明量必须可追溯区分」同属一类约束：<strong>归因边界不可被合并</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"其他法域的对照-为什么不能只做欧盟规则\">其他法域的对照：为什么不能只做欧盟规则</h2><p>跨境上架意味着同一 Listing 面向多法域，规则强度与执法路径差异明显，声明判定必须按目标市场叠加规则集。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n<th>状态（2026）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>2005/29/EC（经 2024/825 修订）</td>\n<td>附件一 2a/4a/4b/4c 硬禁止；第 6 条个案</td>\n<td>已生效，2026-09-27 适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>DMCC Act 2024 + CMA《绿色声明准则》</td>\n<td>不公平商业行为；CMA 获直接处罚权</td>\n<td>准则 2021-09-20 发布；DMCC 执法条款 2025 年生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>FTC《绿色指南》</td>\n<td>自愿性指南，指导 15 U.S.C. §45 执法</td>\n<td>现行为 <strong>2012 年版</strong>；2022-12 更新征求意见悬置至今</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>英国侧的变量在 CMA 的执法姿态：DMCC Act 2024 赋予 CMA 对不公平商业行为的<strong>直接处罚权</strong>（无需上法庭）；其《绿色声明准则》（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/green-claims-code-making-environmental-claims\">GOV.UK, 2021-09-20</a>）要求声明真实、清晰、完整、有据。美国侧相反：FTC《绿色指南》仍停留在 <strong>2012 年版</strong>，2022-12 启动的更新征求意见至今无最终修订（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/topics/truth-advertising/green-guides\">FTC</a>）。结论：<strong>规则集必须按目标市场维度参数化</strong>——同一句「碳中和」声明，在欧盟被 4c 拦截，在英国看依据是否清晰，在美国落在指南「抵消」章节的灰区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声明治理的落点-从审核门控到证据台账\">声明治理的落点：从审核门控到证据台账</h2><p>最小可用结构有三层。<strong>第一层是文本与图像判定</strong>：对标题、五点描述、A+ 内容与标签图做断言抽取，输出带主张对象作用域字段的结构化声明对象；标签图必须走 OCR + 标签白名单（对应 2a）。<strong>第二层是证据要求矩阵</strong>：按声明类别映射到必需证据位——方法学（PEF/ISO 14067）、数据集、核验凭证、有效期；矩阵是配置而非代码。<strong>第三层是证据台账与时效</strong>：每条声明挂一条可核验凭证记录，复用证书状态机跟踪到期、暂停、撤销，价值在审计留痕——举证时能给出「何时、依据什么、由谁核验」的时间序列。</p>\n<p>这套结构里，<strong>声明实体与证书实体必须共用标识符体系</strong>：声明的证据指向一张 PEF 研究、一份 ISO 14067 核验报告或一个 CRCF 认证单位，都应能回指到<a href=\"../eco-label-certification-taxonomy/ecolabel-scheme-taxonomy\">生态标签方案分类</a>中定义的 Scheme 与 Credential。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>反漂绿合规在 2026 年呈现不对称结构，工程上只能分别应对：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>已生效的硬约束是 ECGT 指令（2024/825）</strong>：经 2005/29/EC 附件一新增 2a/4a/4b/4c 四条「任何情况下禁止」，4c 直接封死抵消型碳中和声明；成员国须在 2026-03-27 前转化、2026-09-27 起适用。</li>\n<li><strong>停滞的是绿色声明指令（COM(2023)166）</strong>：2025 年 6 月宣布拟撤回、第三次三方会谈取消，证实细则与独立核验机制没有确定生效日期。</li>\n<li><strong>可落地的工程动作是三层结构</strong>：文本与图像断言抽取（含标签白名单）、证据要求矩阵、复用证书状态机的证据台账。</li>\n<li><strong>多法域规则必须参数化</strong>：英国 DMCC Act 2024 赋予 CMA 直接处罚权，美国 FTC 绿色指南仍停留在 2012 年版。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把声明做成带作用域字段的一等实体、让证据回指到方案与凭证标识符，并以覆盖率指标驱动上架门控——这套设计既不依赖尚未通过的指令，也能在其落地时平滑扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"绿色声明证实与反漂绿合规（Green Claims 指令）","id":"绿色声明证实与反漂绿合规-green-claims-指令"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的监管拼图：一部生效指令与一部停滞指令","id":"2026-年的监管拼图-一部生效指令与一部停滞指令"},{"level":2,"text":"被禁止的声明类型：把法条翻成可枚举的规则","id":"被禁止的声明类型-把法条翻成可枚举的规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从声明到证据的证实链条","id":"核心概念-从声明到证据的证实链条"},{"level":2,"text":"抵消型声明与碳信用：4c 如何改变核算边界","id":"抵消型声明与碳信用-4c-如何改变核算边界"},{"level":2,"text":"其他法域的对照：为什么不能只做欧盟规则","id":"其他法域的对照-为什么不能只做欧盟规则"},{"level":2,"text":"声明治理的落点：从审核门控到证据台账","id":"声明治理的落点-从审核门控到证据台账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字产品护照（DPP）与 ESPR 数据接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/carbon-packaging-dpp-compliance/digital-product-passport-espr"},"next":{"title":"平台可持续准入与商品上架门控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/green-claims-listing-risk/marketplace-sustainability-listing-gate"}}